<p>You take close notice of the target for the next 5 turns. If they attempt to use a non-instant talent you react with incredible speed, firing a shot dealing 25% damage that causes the talent to fail and go on cooldown.</p><p>This shot is instant, cannot miss, and puts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 3, 3</acronym> other talents on cooldown for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 3, 3</acronym> turns.</p>